Package: msamodel
Type: Package
Title: Mutation-Stability-Activity Model of Neutral Structural Evolution
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Author: Julian Echave
Maintainer: Julian Echave <jechave@unsam.edu.ar>
Description: Implementation of the Mutation-Stability-Activity (MSA) model for
    predicting site-specific structural divergence in protein evolution from
    single-point-mutation scans (SPMs). Provides maximum-likelihood and Bayesian
    (adaptive-quadrature) parameter estimation, prediction of divergence profiles
    under mutation-only and selection-only model variants, and a site-level (phi)
    decomposition of evolutionary constraint contributions.
